{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03829","headline":"夜渡江 · 姚崇","name":"夜渡江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜渚带浮烟，苍茫晦远天。\n舟轻不觉动，缆急始知牵。\n听草遥寻岸，闻香暗识莲。\n唯看孤帆影，常似客心悬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚崇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03829.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03829","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}